From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ruhan <35257374+RuhanSA079@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] radxa-cm3-io: turn on the USER and PWR LEDs at power-on

Before this, the board gives no visible feedback between power-on and
whenever Linux's own gpio-leds driver probes late in boot -- both the
SoM's USER LED and the carrier board's PWR LED sit dark the whole time
U-Boot is running.

The SoM's "led-0" (USER LED, rk3566-radxa-cm3.dtsi) already carries
default-state = "on", but it has never taken effect because this board
never enabled U-Boot's LED uclass at all (no CONFIG_LED/CONFIG_LED_GPIO
in the defconfig) -- so led-uclass's post_bind/post_probe default-state
handling in drivers/led/led-uclass.c never ran.

The carrier board's PWR LED (red, gpio4 RK_PB7 active-low -- same GPIO
already used by the Linux-side "pwr-led-red" node) isn't described in
U-Boot's devicetree at all, so it's added here as led-2 alongside the
existing ACT LED (led-1), with its own pinctrl entry. led-1 (ACT,
color=green, function=activity) is left completely untouched -- it has
no default-state property, so enabling the LED uclass does not turn it
on or otherwise change its behavior; it stays dark until Linux's own
heartbeat-trigger driver takes over, exactly as before.

Verified the board dtb still compiles and led-2's gpios/pinctrl-0
resolve to real phandles.

---
 arch/arm/dts/rk3566-radxa-cm3-io.dts  | 13 +++++++++++++
 configs/radxa-cm3-io-rk3566_defconfig |  2 ++
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm/dts/rk3566-radxa-cm3-io.dts b/arch/arm/dts/rk3566-radxa-cm3-io.dts
--- a/arch/arm/dts/rk3566-radxa-cm3-io.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/dts/rk3566-radxa-cm3-io.dts
@@ -50,6 +50,15 @@
 			pinctrl-names = "default";
 			pinctrl-0 = <&pi_nled_activity>;
 		};
+
+		led-2 {
+			gpios = <&gpio4 RK_PB7 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
+			color = <LED_COLOR_ID_RED>;
+			function = LED_FUNCTION_POWER;
+			default-state = "on";
+			pinctrl-names = "default";
+			pinctrl-0 = <&pwr_led>;
+		};
 	};

 	vcc5v0_usb30: vcc5v0-usb30-regulator {
@@ -203,6 +212,10 @@
 		pi_nled_activity: pi-nled-activity {
 			rockchip,pins = <4 RK_PA4 RK_FUNC_GPIO &pcfg_pull_none>;
 		};
+
+		pwr_led: pwr-led {
+			rockchip,pins = <4 RK_PB7 RK_FUNC_GPIO &pcfg_pull_none>;
+		};
 	};

 	sdcard {
diff --git a/configs/radxa-cm3-io-rk3566_defconfig b/configs/radxa-cm3-io-rk3566_defconfig
--- a/configs/radxa-cm3-io-rk3566_defconfig
+++ b/configs/radxa-cm3-io-rk3566_defconfig
@@ -52,6 +52,8 @@
 CONFIG_SPL_SYSCON=y
 CONFIG_SPL_CLK=y
 CONFIG_ROCKCHIP_GPIO=y
+CONFIG_LED=y
+CONFIG_LED_GPIO=y
 CONFIG_SYS_I2C_ROCKCHIP=y
 CONFIG_MISC=y
 CONFIG_SUPPORT_EMMC_RPMB=y
--
2.43.0
